Under  ${\cal P}(\epsilon, \delta)$ policy operating on $KL$ right dense ${\cal {L}}$, for $P$ as above with distributions $F$ and $G$
in ${\cal L}$, for $\delta \in (0,1/2)$, 
\begin{equation} \label{eqn:lemma011}
E_a N_2(\tau)=  \infty. 
\end{equation}

Under ${\cal P}_{a}(\epsilon)$ policy operating on $KL$ right dense ${\cal {L}}$, for $P$ as above with distributions $F$ and $G$
in ${\cal L}$,
\begin{equation} \label{eqn:Kauff4}
\liminf_{\delta \rightarrow 0} \frac{E_P N_2(\tau)} {\log(1/\delta)} = \infty.
\end{equation}
